{
  "name": "brew-dark",
  "note": "DARK-first Brew, eyedropped from the real brew.new hero (make palette \u2192 luminance 0.41, bg #1a1a1a, white text, orange send-button accent #ff742e). This is the ACTUAL product look (the launch film's cream was one film's choice; the shipped app is dark). Near-black field, near-white type, a single vivid orange accent, warm-dark cards. Bold Hanken Grotesk, Geist Mono for {{code}}. Motion: punchy easeOutBack.",
